        1       *================================================================*
        2       * PROGRAMA : FATFILTR (ESQUELETO PARA A TURMA)                   *
        3       * AULA     : 7 - COBOL III, ARQUIVOS SEQUENCIAIS                 *
        4       * OBJETIVO : LER AS TRANSACOES DO DIA (JA ORDENADAS PELO SORT),  *
        5       *            VALIDAR, CLASSIFICAR E SEPARAR EM DOIS ARQUIVOS:    *
        6       *            APROVADAS (FORMATO INTERNO, VALOR EM COMP-3) E      *
        7       *            REJEITADAS (COM MOTIVO).                            *
        8       * ENTRADA  : DD TRANSIN  - CPTRANS, FB 80                        *
        9       * SAIDAS   : DD APROVOUT - CPTRANI, FB 80                        *
       10       *            DD REJEIOUT - CPREJEI, FB 120                       *
       11       * RETORNO  : 0 = OK, 4 = HOUVE REJEITADAS, 16 = ERRO DE ARQUIVO  *
       12       *            OU CONTADORES QUE NAO FECHAM                        *
       13       * O QUE VOCE ESCREVE: A LOGICA DE CADA PARAGRAFO DA PROCEDURE    *
       14       * DIVISION, NO LUGAR DE CADA CONTINUE. AS DIVISOES DE            *
       15       * IDENTIFICACAO, AMBIENTE E DADOS JA ESTAO PRONTAS.              *
       16       * NESTA AULA NAO HA VALIDACAO DO NUMERO DO CARTAO: ELA ENTRA NA  *
       17       * AULA 9, COM O SUBPROGRAMA LUHNVALD.                            *
       18       *================================================================*
       19        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       20        PROGRAM-ID. FATFILTR.
       21 
       22        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       23        INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       24        FILE-CONTROL.
       25            SELECT TRANS-ENTRADA  ASSIGN TO TRANSIN
       26                   FILE STATUS IS WS-FS-ENTRADA.
       27            SELECT TRANS-APROVADA ASSIGN TO APROVOUT
       28                   FILE STATUS IS WS-FS-APROVADA.
       29            SELECT TRANS-REJEITADA ASSIGN TO REJEIOUT
       30                   FILE STATUS IS WS-FS-REJEITADA.
       31 
       32        DATA DIVISION.
       33        FILE SECTION.
       34        FD  TRANS-ENTRADA
       35            RECORDING MODE IS F.
       36            COPY CPTRANS.
       37        FD  TRANS-APROVADA
       38            RECORDING MODE IS F.
       39            COPY CPTRANI.
       40        FD  TRANS-REJEITADA
       41            RECORDING MODE IS F.
       42            COPY CPREJEI.
       43 
       44        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       45        01  WS-FS-ENTRADA              PIC X(02).
       46            88  WS-FS-ENT-OK                     VALUE '00'.
       47            88  WS-FS-ENT-FIM                    VALUE '10'.
       48        01  WS-FS-APROVADA             PIC X(02).
       49            88  WS-FS-APR-OK                     VALUE '00'.
       50        01  WS-FS-REJEITADA            PIC X(02).
       51            88  WS-FS-REJ-OK                     VALUE '00'.
       52 
       53        01  WS-CONTADORES.
       54            05  WS-QTD-LIDOS           PIC 9(07) VALUE ZERO.
       55            05  WS-QTD-APROVADAS       PIC 9(07) VALUE ZERO.
       56            05  WS-QTD-SUSPEITAS       PIC 9(07) VALUE ZERO.
       57            05  WS-QTD-REJEITADAS      PIC 9(07) VALUE ZERO.
       58 
       59        01  WS-LIMITE-SUSPEITA         PIC 9(09)V99 VALUE 5000.00.
       60 
       61        01  WS-VALIDACAO               PIC X(01).
       62            88  WS-REGISTRO-VALIDO               VALUE 'S'.
       63            88  WS-REGISTRO-INVALIDO             VALUE 'N'.
       64 
       65        01  WS-DATA-VALIDAR.
       66            05  WS-DV-ANO              PIC 9(04).
       67            05  WS-DV-MES              PIC 9(02).
       68                88  WS-MES-VALIDO                VALUE 01 THRU 12.
       69            05  WS-DV-DIA              PIC 9(02).
       70                88  WS-DIA-VALIDO                VALUE 01 THRU 31.
       71         01  WS-PGM-LUHN                PIC X(08) VALUE 'LUHNVALD'.
       72            COPY CPLUHN.
       73        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       74        0000-PRINCIPAL.
       75 
       76            PERFORM 1000-INICIALIZAR
       77               THRU 1000-FIM-INICIALIZAR
       78            PERFORM 2000-PROCESSAR 
       79               THRU 2000-FIM-PROCESSAR
       80                  UNTIL WS-FS-ENT-FIM
       81            PERFORM 3000-FINALIZAR
       82               THRU 3000-FIM-FINALIZAR 
       83            STOP RUN.
       84 
       85        1000-INICIALIZAR.
       86 
       87            OPEN INPUT TRANS-ENTRADA
       88            IF NOT WS-FS-ENT-OK
       89               DISPLAY 'FATFILTR - ERRO DE OPEN TRANSIN'
       90               DISPLAY 'FS: ' WS-FS-ENTRADA
       91               PERFORM 9900-ENCERRAR-COM-ERRO
       92            END-IF
       93 
       94            OPEN OUTPUT TRANS-APROVADA
       95            IF NOT WS-FS-APR-OK
       96               DISPLAY 'FATFILTR - ERRO DE OPEN APROVOUT'
       97               DISPLAY 'FS: ' WS-FS-APROVADA
       98               PERFORM 9900-ENCERRAR-COM-ERRO
       99            END-IF
      100 
      101            OPEN OUTPUT TRANS-REJEITADA
      102            IF NOT WS-FS-REJ-OK
      103               DISPLAY 'FATFILTR - ERRO DE OPEN REJEIOUT'
      104                       'FS: ' WS-FS-REJEITADA
      105               PERFORM 9900-ENCERRAR-COM-ERRO
      106            END-IF
      107 
      108            PERFORM 8000-LER-TRANSACAO THRU 8000-FIM-LER-TRANSACAO.
      109        1000-FIM-INICIALIZAR.
      110             EXIT.
      111        2000-PROCESSAR.
      112            
      113            PERFORM 2100-VALIDAR-TRANSACAO
      114               THRU 2100-FIM-VALIDAR-TRANSACAO
      115 
      116            IF WS-REGISTRO-VALIDO
      117               PERFORM 2200-GRAVAR-APROVADA
      118                THRU 2200-FIM-GRAVAR-APROVADA
      119            ELSE
      120               PERFORM 2300-GRAVAR-REJEITADA
      121                 THRU 2300-FIM-GRAVAR-REJEITADA 
      122            END-IF
      123 
      124            PERFORM 8000-LER-TRANSACAO THRU 8000-FIM-LER-TRANSACAO.
      125         2000-FIM-PROCESSAR.
      126            EXIT.
      127        2100-VALIDAR-TRANSACAO.
      128 
      129            MOVE SPACES TO REG-REJEITADA
      130            SET WS-REGISTRO-VALIDO TO TRUE
      131            MOVE TR-DATA-TRANSACAO TO WS-DATA-VALIDAR
      132            
      133            MOVE TR-NUM-CARTAO     TO LK-NUM-CARTAO
      134            CALL WS-PGM-LUHN USING LK-AREA-LUHN
      135 
      136            EVALUATE TRUE
      137               WHEN LK-CARTAO-INVALIDO
      138                    SET WS-REGISTRO-INVALIDO TO TRUE
      139                    MOVE 'CARTAO INVALIDO'
      140                                             TO RJ-DESC-MOTIVO
      141               WHEN TR-VALOR IS NOT NUMERIC
      142                    SET WS-REGISTRO-INVALIDO   TO TRUE 
      143                    SET RJ-VALOR-INVALIDO      TO TRUE
      144                    MOVE 'VALOR NAO NUMERICO'
      145                                             TO RJ-DESC-MOTIVO
      146               WHEN TR-VALOR = ZERO
      147                    SET WS-REGISTRO-INVALIDO   TO TRUE 
      148                    SET RJ-VALOR-INVALIDO      TO TRUE
      149                    MOVE 'VALOR ZERADO'
      150                                             TO RJ-DESC-MOTIVO
      151               WHEN NOT WS-MES-VALIDO
      152                     SET WS-REGISTRO-INVALIDO TO TRUE
      153                     SET RJ-DATA-INVALIDA TO TRUE
      154                     MOVE 'DATA INVALIDA'
      155                                             TO RJ-DESC-MOTIVO      
      156                WHEN NOT WS-DIA-VALIDO
      157                     SET WS-REGISTRO-INVALIDO TO TRUE
      158                     SET RJ-DATA-INVALIDA TO TRUE
      159                     MOVE 'DATA INVALIDA'
      160                                             TO RJ-DESC-MOTIVO 
      161                WHEN TR-NEGADA
      162                     SET WS-REGISTRO-INVALIDO TO TRUE
      163                     SET RJ-TRANSACAO-NEGADA TO TRUE
      164                     MOVE 'TRANSACAO NEGADA'
      165                                             TO RJ-DESC-MOTIVO           
      166             END-EVALUATE.
      167        2100-FIM-VALIDAR-TRANSACAO.
      168            EXIT.
      169        2200-GRAVAR-APROVADA.
      170            MOVE SPACES TO REG-TRANS-INTERNA
      171            INITIALIZE REG-TRANS-INTERNA
      172            MOVE TR-NUM-CARTAO      TO TI-NUM-CARTAO
      173            MOVE TR-DATA-TRANSACAO  TO TI-DATA-TRANSACAO
      174            MOVE TR-HORA-TRANSACAO  TO TI-HORA-TRANSACAO
      175            MOVE TR-VALOR           TO TI-VALOR
      176            MOVE TR-MCC             TO TI-MCC
      177            MOVE TR-PAIS            TO TI-PAIS
      178            MOVE TR-COD-AUTORIZACAO TO TI-COD-AUTORIZACAO
      179            MOVE TR-ESTABELECIMENTO TO TI-ESTABELECIMENTO
      180 
      181            IF NOT TR-NACIONAL
      182               AND TR-VALOR > WS-LIMITE-SUSPEITA
      183 
      184               SET TI-SUSPEITA TO TRUE
      185               ADD 1 TO WS-QTD-SUSPEITAS
      186            ELSE
      187               SET TI-NORMAL TO TRUE
      188            END-IF
      189 
      190            WRITE REG-TRANS-INTERNA
      191 
      192            IF NOT WS-FS-APR-OK
      193               DISPLAY 'FATFILTR - ERRO WRITE APROVOUT'
      194               DISPLAY 'FS: ' WS-FS-APROVADA
      195               PERFORM 9900-ENCERRAR-COM-ERRO
      196            END-IF
      197 
      198            ADD 1 TO WS-QTD-APROVADAS
      199            .
      200 
      201        2200-FIM-GRAVAR-APROVADA.
      202             EXIT.
      203 
      204        2300-GRAVAR-REJEITADA.
      205            MOVE REG-TRANSACAO
      206               TO RJ-REGISTRO-ORIGINAL
      207 
      208            WRITE REG-REJEITADA
      209 
      210            IF NOT WS-FS-REJ-OK
      211               DISPLAY 'FATFILTR - ERRO WRITE REJEIOUT'
      212               DISPLAY 'FS: ' WS-FS-REJEITADA
      213               PERFORM 9900-ENCERRAR-COM-ERRO
      214            END-IF
      215 
      216            ADD 1 TO WS-QTD-REJEITADAS
      217            .
      218        2300-FIM-GRAVAR-REJEITADA.
      219            EXIT.
      220        3000-FINALIZAR.
      221            CLOSE TRANS-ENTRADA
      222                  TRANS-APROVADA
      223                  TRANS-REJEITADA
      224 
      225            DISPLAY 'QTD LIDOS      : ' WS-QTD-LIDOS
      226            DISPLAY 'QTD APROVADAS  : ' WS-QTD-APROVADAS
      227            DISPLAY 'QTD SUSPEITAS  : ' WS-QTD-SUSPEITAS
      228            DISPLAY 'QTD REJEITADAS : ' WS-QTD-REJEITADAS
      229 
      230            IF WS-QTD-LIDOS NOT =
      231               WS-QTD-APROVADAS + WS-QTD-REJEITADAS
      232 
      233               MOVE 16 TO RETURN-CODE
      234            ELSE
      235               IF WS-QTD-REJEITADAS > ZERO
      236                  MOVE 4 TO RETURN-CODE
      237               ELSE
      238                  MOVE 0 TO RETURN-CODE
      239               END-IF
      240            END-IF
      241            .
      242        3000-FIM-FINALIZAR.
      243            EXIT.
      244        8000-LER-TRANSACAO.
      245 
      246            READ TRANS-ENTRADA
      247                 AT END 
      248                    CONTINUE
      249                 NOT AT END
      250                    ADD 1 TO WS-QTD-LIDOS
      251            END-READ
      252 
      253            IF NOT WS-FS-ENT-OK AND NOT WS-FS-ENT-FIM 
      254               DISPLAY 'FATFILTR - ERRO DE READ TRANS-ENTRADA (TRANSIN)'
      255                       'FS: ' WS-FS-ENTRADA 
      256               PERFORM 9900-ENCERRAR-COM-ERRO
      257            END-IF
      258            .
      259        8000-FIM-LER-TRANSACAO. 
      260            EXIT.
      261        9900-ENCERRAR-COM-ERRO.
      262       *    PRONTO: ENCERRA COM RC 16 PARA IMPEDIR OS STEPS SEGUINTES.
      263            MOVE 16 TO RETURN-CODE
      264            STOP RUN
      265            .
